# Environment files are split by Supabase target. Copy ONE of these (never commit the copy):
#   .env.local.example  -> .env.local  (Supabase Docker stack on this machine)
#   .env.cloud.example  -> .env.cloud  (supabase.com project)
# Select at run time:  $env:ENV_FILE=".env.local"; docker compose up -d --build   (default: .env)
# Empty SUPABASE_URL/SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY = browser-only local mode.
# Details: docs/08-ops/SUPABASE_ENVIRONMENTS.md

# Google Search Console connection (CF-07b, docs/01-planning/ANALYTICS_SYNC.md). Unset = "not connected", APIs answer 503.
#   GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET : web-application OAuth client; redirect URI {APP_URL}/api/integrations/google/callback
#   ANALYTICS_TOKEN_KEYS : "<version>:<base64 of 32 random bytes>[,<version>:<base64>]" - newest version encrypts, all decrypt
#   GOOGLE_OAUTH_BASE / GOOGLE_API_BASE : test-only overrides (fake Google server); leave unset in real use
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
# ANALYTICS_TOKEN_KEYS=
